text_sentences:
['To constrain the weights to -1, 0, or +1, we adopt an absmean quantization function. It first scales the weight matrix by its average absolute value, and then round each value to the nearest integer among \{-1, 0, +1\}:', '\begin{equation}
    \widetilde{W} = \mathrm{RoundClip}(\frac{W}{\gamma + \epsilon}, -1, 1),
\end{equation}', '\begin{equation}
    \gamma = \frac{1}{nm}\sum_{ij} |W_{ij}|.
\end{equation}', '\begin{equation}
    \mathrm{RoundClip}(x, a, b) = \max(a, \min(b, \mathrm{round}(x))),
\end{equation}']
